WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:23.022 --> 00:00:27.494
For as long as I can remember,
I have looked for an equal...

00:00:28.862 --> 00:00:31.164
one who could push me...

00:00:35.535 --> 00:00:37.670
one who could surprise me...

00:00:42.509 --> 00:00:45.044
one who could even beat me.

00:00:48.748 --> 00:00:52.752
Yet all I found
is disappointment.

00:00:56.122 --> 00:01:00.460
Will one of you finally
give me what I desire?

00:01:09.769 --> 00:01:12.005
Yes...

00:01:13.072 --> 00:01:15.175
We will.

